flowchart LR

    A[User Query]
    --> B[Embedding Model]

    B --> C{Cache hit?}

    C -->|Yes| D[Return Cached Response]

    C -->|No| E[Embedding Classifier]

    E --> F[qwen-coder]
    E --> G[deepseek-r1]
    E --> H[gemma3]
    E --> I[llama3.2]

    F --> J[ChromaDB Memory]
    G --> J
    H --> J
    I --> J

    J --> K[Generate Response]

    K --> L{Coding?}

    L -->|Yes| M[Code Validator]
    L -->|No| N[Cheap Validator]

    M --> O{Pass?}
    N --> P{High Confidence?}

    O -->|No| Q[Deep Validator]
    P -->|No| Q

    O -->|Yes| R[Store in ChromaDB]
    P -->|Yes| R
    Q --> R

    R --> S[Final Response]